    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T03:32:07.587624+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers click hack stories not for the vulnerability details but for the real-time 'is my money safe?' signal — the most-clicked headlines are overwhelmingly breaking alerts with on-chain evidence or exchange loss figures, revealing that trust collapse and immediate financial exposure outweigh technical post-mortems.",
